{
  "title": "RDS · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "관계형 데이터베이스의 프로비저닝·백업·운영 일부를 관리한다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#database-engines\">Database Engines</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#db-instances-and-storage\">DB Instances and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#db-subnet-groups-and-security\">DB Subnet Groups and Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#parameter-groups-and-option-groups\">Parameter Groups and Option Groups</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#automated-backups-and-snapshots\">Automated Backups and Snapshots</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#multi-az-and-read-replicas\">Multi-AZ and Read Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#authentication-and-encryption\">Authentication and Encryption</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#maintenance-and-blue-green-deployments\">Maintenance and Blue/Green Deployments</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-custom\">RDS Custom</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>38 / 62</span></div><h1>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 10 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span>는 관계형 Database의 배포·Backup·패치·장애 복구 작업을 관리하는 서비스다. SQL Schema, Index, Query, Connection과 애플리케이션의 Transaction 설계는 사용자가 계속 관리한다.</p><p>성능 문제를 읽기 부하, 쓰기 부하, 연결 수, Storage I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>로 나누어 판단한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>, 큰 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>, Storage 변경은 서로 다른 병목을 다룬다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"병목별 구성 선택\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>병목별 구성 선택</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Availability</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Primary DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span></strong><small>운영 Transaction</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a></strong><small>다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 복제본</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Failover</strong><small>앱 재연결 필요</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Load management</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Read / Connection load</strong><small>병목 구분</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a></strong><small>읽기 분산 또는 연결 Pool</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Application routing</strong><small>Query·Connection 경로 설정</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Compute·Storage 성능과 Query·Schema 최적화도 함께 검토한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"database-engines\"><h2>Database Engines<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#database-engines\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span>는 Db2, MariaDB, Microsoft SQL Server, MySQL, Oracle, PostgreSQL 등 지원 Engine을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>는 MySQL·PostgreSQL 호환의 별도 관리형 Engine이다. Edition·Version·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 따라 License와 Feature 지원이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"db-instances-and-storage\"><h2>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instances and Storage<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#db-instances-and-storage\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Instance Class가 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Network를 결정하고 Storage Type·Size·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#iops-throughput-and-latency\">IOPS</a>가 Disk 성능을 결정한다. Storage <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>은 설정 한도까지 저장 용량을 늘린다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> 수를 늘려도 단일 Writer의 쓰기 병목이 자동 해결되지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"db-subnet-groups-and-security\"><h2>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Subnet Groups and Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#db-subnet-groups-and-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Subnet Group은 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>를 배치할 Subnet 집합이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, Encryption과 인증을 함께 설정한다. Public Accessibility는 Network 도달성 설정이며 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 사용자 권한까지 부여하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"parameter-groups-and-option-groups\"><h2>Parameter Groups and Option Groups<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#parameter-groups-and-option-groups\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#parameter-groups-and-option-groups\">Parameter Group</a>은 Engine 설정을, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#parameter-groups-and-option-groups\">Option Group</a>은 지원 Engine의 추가 기능을 관리한다. 일부 변경은 재시작이나 Maintenance Window가 필요하다. 운영 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 변경 전에 적용 방식과 호환성을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"automated-backups-and-snapshots\"><h2>Automated Backups and Snapshots<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#automated-backups-and-snapshots\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Automated Backup과 Transaction Log로 보존 범위 내 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/#backups-pitr-and-cloning\">PITR</a>을 제공한다. Manual Snapshot은 별도 보존·삭제 정책을 갖는다. 일반 Restore는 새 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>를 생성하므로 Endpoint 변경·접속 전환을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/#recovery-time-objective\">RTO</a>에 포함한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"multi-az-and-read-replicas\"><h2>Multi-AZ <span class=\"full-name\">(Availability Zone)</span> and Read Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#multi-az-and-read-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-instance-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Instance</a>는 가용성을 위한 Standby를 두고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 분산을 위한 별도 Endpoint를 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/#multi-az-db-cluster-deployment\">Multi-AZ DB Cluster</a>는 읽을 수 있는 Standby가 있는 다른 모델이다. 두 기능의 이름만 보고 같은 역할로 취급하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"rds-proxy\"><h2>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span> Proxy<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>관리형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">Connection Pool</a>로 많은 짧은 연결을 재사용하고 지원 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>의 Failover 대응을 돕는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a> 등 연결 수가 급증하는 앱에 유용하다. Query 자체를 Cache하거나 Database Compute를 무한히 늘리는 기능은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"authentication-and-encryption\"><h2>Authentication and Encryption<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#authentication-and-encryption\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> Native 인증, 지원 Engine의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> Database Authentication·Directory 통합을 비교한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/kms/\">KMS</a>는 At-rest, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/acm/\">TLS</a>는 In-transit 보호에 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a> 인증이 SQL Table 권한이나 Network 접근을 모두 대신하지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"maintenance-and-blue-green-deployments\"><h2>Maintenance and Blue/Green Deployments<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#maintenance-and-blue-green-deployments\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Maintenance Window는 관리 작업 시점을 조정한다. 지원 Engine의 Blue/Green Deployments는 변경 환경을 준비하고 전환하도록 돕는다. 모든 Schema 변경·Engine·Version이 무중단으로 지원되는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"rds-custom\"><h2>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span> Custom<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-custom\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Oracle·SQL Server에서 OS·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 환경에 추가 관리 권한을 제공하는 모델이다. 표준 RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span>보다 사용자의 운영 책임이 늘어난다. 일반 RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span>에서 OS에 직접 SSH할 수 있다고 가정하지 않는다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/lambda/\">Lambda</a>의 동시 실행 증가로 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 연결이 고갈되면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/#rds-proxy\">RDS Proxy</a>를 검토한다. 읽기 Query가 과도하면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 장애 복구가 목표면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a>를 함께 설계한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>RDS <span class=\"full-name\">(Relational Database Service)</span>가 애플리케이션 쿼리 설계나 스키마를 대신하지는 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/Welcome.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q052\" data-question=\"Q052\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q052</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q052/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to centrally manage backup schedules and retention policies for EBS and RDS across multiple accounts. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Network Load Balancer</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP alone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Backup</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q052\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a>은 지원 리소스의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">백업</a> 계획과 보존을 중앙화한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/backup/\">AWS Backup</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q053\" data-question=\"Q053\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q053</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q053/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to reduce patching and backup administration for a MySQL-compatible relational database. Which service is a primary candidate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q053\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon RDS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q053\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SQS</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q053\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon S3</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q053\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon CloudFront</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>는 관리형 관계형 데이터베이스다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q056\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/quicksight/\">이전 용어 <b>QuickSight / Quick Sight</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">다음 용어 <b>RDS Multi-AZ</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
